From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kanadaj <kanadaj@royalroad.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:38:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add a vlogs schema for VictoriaLogs stream fields

Grafana Alloy ships pod logs to VictoriaLogs with the stream fields
namespace, pod, container and level (alloy-modules log-levels), not the
ViaQ or OTel names. Make that the default schema, match levels
case-insensitively with the spellings the log-levels module extracts
(klog, zerolog, common words), and start from the LogsQL query `*`.
---
 web/src/attribute-filters.tsx         |  2 +-
 web/src/backend-client.ts             |  2 +-
 web/src/components/logs-histogram.tsx |  2 +-
 web/src/hooks/useURLState.ts          |  4 ++++
 web/src/logs.types.ts                 |  5 ++++-
 web/src/parse-resources.tsx           | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 web/src/severity.ts                   | 25 +++++++++++++++++++-----
 web/src/value-utils.ts                |  3 +++
 8 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

